# --- 1.3.14 to 1.3.93 ------------------------------------------------------
#
# Eighty gists, and none of them typed out. The conditions are already written
# down once, in `atmanepada.PROVISIONS`, and a second hand-written copy here
# would be the same facts twice with two chances to disagree. So the line is
# built from the provision, and the worked form is the Kāśikā's own example run
# through the project's transliterator so that it carries both scripts.
